      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know if i should go to the er it's so expensive and i feel okay mostly, just itchy. like the throat thing is more just a weird sensation, not like i cant breathe or anything. wouldnt a high dose of benadryl go away the hives and the throat thing pretty fast so i dont have to go to the hospital?",
